<description>&lt;p&gt;Syria is now sending military personnel and advice to Saudi Arabia to counter Houthi attacks, linked to a defence cooperation deal that includes $403 million in loans. Israeli forces have carried out more than 60 cross-border violations in Syria since early November, including shelling in Quneitra and strikes in Syria and Lebanon. Syrian authorities condemned a terrorist attack on security personnel in Amman and an attack on Egyptian border guards that killed two officers. A 55‑year-old man died when an unexploded ordnance exploded in Hama. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/6/turkiyes-parliament-ratifies-mecca-defence-agreement&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQTEp0NE1RMkFEemJQVzlLQW5ta2NaMzlzS0IwYUdpN2RNM0FrNDRVR0gxdnJfVXBSSDRZSUUwRHA2ZVdCa0VaazhiZ0M1R0ZLTlJtYzRob1didXpWREJXMmFJNUJWazlXN1VoVTN3TE5hNC1UUlNIUlJrYUVzTEhrVi1WUGxFblNfeldCbzdqTDZkTndScl9DdDZzbDBfQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Arab Weekly&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQOUxnaWctNF90QTJDN3RaNnE5VkFfdk4xbTZHWHduTEtWREtYZFNwdmlqTHpnbmN4WGVTUWF4M0lwQmd1amg2eVI5VFFSQV91N3A4V2VzUE1MQ2ZPaXFnZTJGTVZvYXlMVmMwUk5nYnFURGFieHF6ZnJ6STNtOUR1NzlKWG1MM0lHYXVlaVJjRzY1YWF4UmE0ejdWUUh3SFVWblFXc2k0YnZmU3p2SGRteHpfZDhKeUxD?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxQcWNRLVVDS1dQanI1RFFKSWR5Tmt1c2VfNkhWLW1ROFNLc0tGblRHOVFXUGNPUUZ1dE1Dbm5pc3NOdjRMNFExQm1oUmFGbTkyUWJKMXNIZVk4TTduaU1uU2tUUEtPOEszeUlJMDhYdG1tOXZLMy1IZXl5Y185TUt0TGk0LXRXLTBZMVR5eEFtVjJOa2xZd0lCQXlpLUlXRnRZbVZLRGJ2RVhEMzk4MUlqQ3NvYW9Rdmhwam93a0Z6bEZvdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;J